---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy | Mosselora"
  description="Privacy notice for the Mosselora website and one-puzzle browser preview."
>
  <article class="text-page section-wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy notice</p>
    <h1>What this site does with data.</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Updated November 23, 2026. This notice covers mosselora.com and the browser research preview only. The mobile game has not been released.</p>

    <h2>No forms or tracking</h2>
    <p>This site does not have accounts, contact forms, advertising, or analytics scripts. The browser preview keeps puzzle actions in the page and does not send them to a server or save them in browser storage.</p>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare delivers and protects this site. Cloudflare may process technical request information as part of providing its service. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> for its handling of that information.</p>

    <h2>The mobile game</h2>
    <p>The game is designed to play offline and save progress on the device. Its production binary has not passed final dependency, network, or store privacy review. We will publish the mobile app's final privacy disclosures before the app is submitted for release.</p>

    <p><a class="text-link" href="/support/">Read support information</a></p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
